  "markdown": "**SAMPLE,** this page for reference only\n\n**Application for Disability Insurance (DI) Benefits – Physician or Practitioner's Certificate**\n\n**Print with black ink.**\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"20\">**Part B - Physician or Practitioner's Certificate**</td></tr>\n<tr><td>B1. Patient's Social Security Number</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>B2. Patient's file number</td><td>6</td><td>9</td><td>-</td><td>6</td><td>4</td><td>2</td><td>-</td><td>3</td><td>8</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nB3. If you know the patient's electronic receipt number, enter it here:\n\n<table>\n<tr><td>R</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n- **B4. Patient's date of birth**: 0 1 0 1 1 9 0 0\n\n<table>\n<tr><td>B5. Patient's name</td><td>(First)</td><td></td><td>(MI)</td><td></td><td>(Last)</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Sample</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>CI</td><td></td><td>a</td><td>i</td><td>m</td><td>a</td><td>n</td><td>t</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n- **B6. Physician or Practitioner's license number**: 634-027930\n\n**B7.** State **or** country (if not U.S.A.) that issued license number entered in B6\n\n- **State**: C A\n- **Country**: [blank]\n\n- **B8. Physician or Practitioner license type**: M D\n- **B9. Specialty (if any)**: [blank]\n\n- **B10. Physician or Practitioner's name as shown on license**: [blank]\n- **(First)**: Geoff\n- **(MI)**: [blank]\n- **(Last)**: Booker\n- **Suffix**: [blank]\n\n**B11. Physician or Practitioner's address**\n\n- **Mailing Address, PO Box or Number, Street, Suite#**: 269 Commerce\n- **City**: Anywhere\n- **State**: CA\n- **Zip or Postal Code**: 72694\n- **Country (If Not U.S.A.)**: [blank]\n\n**County Hospital or Government Facility address**\n\n- **Facility Name (if applicable)**: [blank]\n- **Number, Street, Suite#**: [blank]\n- **City**: [blank]\n- **State**: [blank]\n- **Zip or Postal Code**: [blank]\n- **Country (If Not U.S.A.)**: [blank]\n\n- **B12. This patient has been under my care and treatment for this medical problem**\n\n- **From**: 01252025\n- **To**: [blank]\n- [x] Check here to indicate you are still treating the patient\n\n- **At Intervals Of**:\n  - [ ] Daily\n  - [ ] Weekly\n  - [x] Monthly\n  - [ ] As Needed\n  - [ ] Other\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">B13. At any time during your attendance for this medical problem, has the patient been incapable of performing their regular or customary work?</td></tr>\n<tr><td>[x] Yes - enter date disability began<br>01252025</td><td>[ ] No - skip to B33</td></tr>\n<tr><td>MMDDYYYY<br>Was the disability caused by an accident or trauma?<br>If yes, indicate the date the accident or trauma occurred.</td><td>[ ] Yes<br>[ ] No</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n- **B14.** Date you released or anticipate releasing patient to return to their regular or customary work (\"unknown\", \"indefinite\", etc., not acceptable.)\n\n  [blank]\n\n- [ ] Check here to indicate patient's disability is permanent and you never anticipate releasing patient to return to their regular or customary work\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"16\">B15. If patient is now pregnant or has been pregnant, please check the appropriate box and enter the following:</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Estimated delivery date:</td><td>M</td><td>M</td><td>D</td><td>D</td><td>Y</td><td>Y</td><td>Y Y</td><td>[ ] Date pregnancy ended:</td><td>M</td><td>M</td><td>D</td><td>D</td><td>Y</td><td>Y</td><td>Y Y</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Type of delivery, if patient has delivered:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td colsp